values ('f0a1b2c3-4d5e-4a94-9d34-4b5c6d7e8f44', 'building-materials-and-construction', 'Building Materials and Construction', 'Building Materials and Construction introduces the physical, environmental, technical, and professional logic that turns architectural design into built form. Students learn how major materials behave, how assemblies manage structure and enclosure, how details mediate movement and water, how codes and construction sequencing shape decisions, and how carbon, health, labor, safety, cost, and maintenance affect responsible material choices.');

