abor sequencing, fatigue, and weather exposure"}, {"id": "831ff235-96f4-44d7-8c52-fff4151b3ded", "type": "concept", "title": "Ethical design for safe construction and maintenance"}], "description": "This subtopic connects design decisions to worker safety, installation risk, and respect for trades."}, {"id": "2353566c-a873-4028-8584-da0e51147205", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Capstone Assembly Package", "children": [{"id": "8b02e7d8-deb5-4d87-bb71-a22d762acb92", "type": "concept", "title": "Material selection matrix"}, {"id": "3dc46dd7-05ab-45c7-bf4c-bec554ed2316", "type": "concept", "title": "Wall section, enlarged details, and control-layer diagram"}, {"id": "04b6cdb0-1b58-44fe-b983-07f55e273a79", "type": "concept", "title": "Sequencing narrative and constructability notes"}, {"id": "3c67411a-858c-495a-b9ce-9ca9604b9f77", "type": "concept", "title": "Carbon, cost, safety, and maintenance reflection"}], "description": "Students produce a coordinated technical package for a selected wall, roof, floor, facade, or interior assembly."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$bmatjson$::jsonb,
